# Removes the worktree of every branch a pull request merged, then
# fast-forwards the main checkout, listing only what it changed. A post-merge
# hook never undoes the merge, so a prune that fails shows its failure here
# instead of hiding it; a repository with no origin remote has nothing to
# prune, and the pruner exits 0 there itself.
node "$(dirname "$0")/../scripts/prune-worktrees.mjs" --quiet
